<p data-start="606" data-end="708" class="">Ich werde stattdessen die Entwicklungen korrekt <strong data-start="654" data-end="666">per Hand</strong> durchfÃ¼hren, modulo Potenzen von <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span></span></span></span>:</p>
