<li data-start="3757" data-end="3849" class="">
<p data-start="3759" data-end="3849" class="">NÃ¼tzlich in <strong data-start="3771" data-end="3799">cristalliner Kohomologie</strong>, <strong data-start="3801" data-end="3819">perfekte RÃ¤ume</strong>, und <strong data-start="3825" data-end="3848">p-divisible Gruppen</strong>.</p>
