<li data-start="4040" data-end="4102" class="">
<p data-start="4043" data-end="4102" class=""><strong data-start="4043" data-end="4065">Perfektoide KÃ¶rper</strong> und <strong data-start="4070" data-end="4079">Tilts</strong> erzeugen die Struktur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4103" data-end="4160" class="">
<p data-start="4106" data-end="4160" class=""><strong data-start="4106" data-end="4118">Diamonds</strong> sind die RÃ¤ume, in denen wir vergleichen.</p>
