<li data-start="4242" data-end="4357" class="">
<p data-start="4245" data-end="4357" class=""><strong data-start="4245" data-end="4263">Cartier-Moduln</strong> und Operatoren kontrollieren algebraisch-differenzielle Strukturen in Charakteristik <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span></span></span></span>.</p>
